<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108381" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποζεύγνῡμι</span></b> , pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέζευχα</span> Orusap.<i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			786.5
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>yoke under, put under the yoke,</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> of the animals yoked, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. ἵππονς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.81
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.69
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμιόνους . . ζεῦξαν ὑπ᾽ ἀπήνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.73
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὑρῆας ὑποζεύξασθαι ἀπήνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.841
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> metaph.,
				<i>subjugate,</i> Orus l. c.:—
				Pass.
			, <i>submit</i> to, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷδ᾽ ὑπεζύγην πόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the
			chariot, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρμ᾽ ὐπαζεύξαισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποζεύξασθαι τέθριππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cam.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bring under</i> a class, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ δουλικὸν ὑ. γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					309a
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεζεῦχθαι ἑνὶ γένει</span>
			<i>to be brought under</i> one and the same class, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				644a18
			</span></i>.</div>
